        <mxCell id="readme" value="&lt;b&gt;Reading this diagram:&lt;/b&gt; follow the thick arrows top&#8209;to&#8209;bottom &#8212; that is one force sample's journey. The thick green arrow on the right is the only path back to the backend.&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Two numbers to remember:&lt;/b&gt; 100 Hz (sample rate, set by dataIntervalMs) and 12 channels (4 boards &#215; 3 axes, flat index = board&#215;3 + axis).&#xa;&lt;b&gt;Where things get calibrated:&lt;/b&gt; the wire carries raw voltage ratios; Newtons only exist after step 5 of parseSerialLine, in the browser." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1">
